00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:12,630
Daniel is reading two online news reports about natural disasters.

3
00:00:12,630 --> 00:00:17,520
Read with him and answer the questions below.

4
00:00:17,520 --> 00:00:21,500
Snowstorm hits Hailongjiang.

5
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:32,490
Last night, there was a heavy snowstorm in the north of Hailongjiang province, and many homes are still without power this morning.

6
00:00:32,490 --> 00:00:39,320
The storm hit at about 9pm, and some people were trapped in their cars.

7
00:00:39,320 --> 00:00:43,560
Right now, firemen are working hard to help them.

8
00:00:43,560 --> 00:00:47,880
We will keep reporting on this developing situation.

9
00:00:47,880 --> 00:00:50,830
Bushfires in Australia.

10
00:00:50,830 --> 00:00:55,040
Bushfires hit parts of Australia yesterday.

11
00:00:55,040 --> 00:01:02,700
Hot temperatures, no rain, and high winds are increasing the size and power of the bushfires.

12
00:01:02,700 --> 00:01:11,800
The bushfires may burn huge areas of land and destroy thousands of homes before they are put out.

13
00:01:11,800 --> 00:01:16,530
So far, five people are dead, including a fireman.

14
00:01:16,530 --> 00:01:19,040
Many animals died too.

15
00:01:19,040 --> 00:01:22,260
The dangers of bushfires are real.

16
00:01:22,260 --> 00:01:26,160
Everyone nearby should stay at home, said an officer.
